OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boleo sees trains cancelled
OL,4,Aand fallen trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FRailway services have been disrupted
OL,7,Fand power cut off as Storm Boleo has
OL,8,Fbrought high winds and power outages
OL,9,Facross the West Midlands.
OL,11,FCrossCountry trains between Birmingham
OL,12,FNew Street and Nuneaton have been
OL,13,Fcancelled, due to a tree on the line.
OL,14,FThe operator said tickets could be used
OL,15,Fon other services, and it had requested
OL,16,Frail replacement buses.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
