OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boleo sees trains cancelled
OL,4,Aand fallen trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Railway trains between
OL,7,FFour Oaks, Birmingham, and Lichfield
OL,8,FTrent Valley, Staffordshire, were
OL,9,Fcancelled in both directions due to a
OL,10,Fdowned tree. The line has since
OL,11,Freopened.
OL,13,FTransport for Wales services between
OL,14,FCardiff and Shrewsbury have been
OL,15,Fcancelled, and disruption has been
OL,16,Freported between Aberystwyth and
OL,17,FShrewsbury.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
